@startuml ex8-nutrition-order
skinparam svgDimensionStyle false
title
	Diet Order with Hold and Reactivation
end title

hide footbox

skinparam Note<<resource>> {
    FontName Consolas
    FontSize 14
    BorderColor Black
}

actor "Practitioner" as Practitioner
participant "Placer\n(EHR)" as Placer
participant "Dietary System\n(Fulfiller)" as Dietary

group #eee Ordering
Practitioner -> Placer: Order a diet for the patient
Placer -> Placer: create **NutritionOrder**

note left <<resource>> #lightgreen
**NutritionOrder**
|_ .id = **diet-1**
|_ .status = **active**
|_ .intent = order
|_ .oralDiet.type = Diabetic diet
|_ ...
end note
end

group Request fulfillment
Placer -> Dietary: POST **Coordination Task**
note right <<resource>> #pink
**Task**
|_ .id = **task-1**
|_ .status = **requested**
|_ .intent = order
|_ .code = fulfill
|_ .focus = NutritionOrder diet-1
|_ ...
end note
Placer -> Dietary: Subscribe to updates of Task task-1

Dietary -> Placer: GET NutritionOrder diet-1
Placer --> Dietary: NutritionOrder diet-1

Dietary -> Dietary: Accept the request
note right <<resource>> #pink
**Task**
|_ .status = **accepted**
|_ ...
end note
Dietary -> Placer: Notification: Task task-1 updated
end

group Progress
Dietary -> Dietary: Assign the diet
note right <<resource>> #pink
**Task**
|_ .status = **in-progress**
|_ .businessStatus = diet assigned
|_ ...
end note
Dietary -> Placer: Notification: Task task-1 updated

Dietary -> Dietary: Prepare meals
note right <<resource>> #pink
**Task**
|_ .status = in-progress
|_ .businessStatus = **meals being prepared**
|_ ...
end note
Dietary -> Placer: Notification: Task task-1 updated
end

group Hold
Practitioner -> Placer: Hold the diet\n(e.g. patient fasting before a procedure)
Placer -> Placer: update **NutritionOrder**
note left <<resource>> #lightgreen
**NutritionOrder**
|_ .status = **on-hold**
|_ ...
end note
Placer -> Dietary: PUT **Coordination Task**
note right <<resource>> #pink
**Task**
|_ .status = **on-hold**
|_ .statusReason = patient fasting
|_ ...
end note
Dietary -> Dietary: Stop meal preparation
end

group Reactivation
Practitioner -> Placer: Resume the diet
Placer -> Placer: update **NutritionOrder**
note left <<resource>> #lightgreen
**NutritionOrder**
|_ .status = **active**
|_ ...
end note
Placer -> Dietary: PUT **Coordination Task**
note right <<resource>> #pink
**Task**
|_ .status = **in-progress**
|_ ...
end note
Dietary -> Dietary: Resume meal preparation
note right <<resource>> #pink
**Task**
|_ .status = in-progress
|_ .businessStatus = **meals being prepared**
|_ ...
end note
Dietary -> Placer: Notification: Task task-1 updated
end

group #eee At any time
Placer -> Dietary: GET Task task-1
Dietary --> Placer: current fulfillment status
Dietary -> Placer: GET NutritionOrder diet-1
Placer --> Dietary: current diet
end
@enduml
